ept form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8x+6y & =-19 \\\\ 6y & =-8x-19 \\\\ y & =-\\frac{8}{6}x-\\frac{19}{6} \\\\ y & =-\\frac{4}{3}x-\\frac{19}{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn slope-intercept form, the slope is the $x$-coefficient. So, the slope of the given line is $-\\frac{4}{3}.$\n\nLooking at the answer choices, the line $y=\\frac{3}{4}x+1$ has a slope of $\\frac{3}{4}.$\n\nMultiplying the slopes together, we have\n\n$$\n(-\\frac{4}{3})\\cdot \\frac{3}{4}=-1.\n$$\n\nSince the slopes multiply to $-1,$ we conclude that the line $y=\\frac{3}{4}x+1$ is perpendicular to the given line." 13194139535546 17592186045443 true] [17592186514704 1075 #edb/ref 17592186514715 13194139535546 17592186045443 true] [17592186514704 1075 #edb/ref 17592186514718 13194139535546 17592186045443 true] [17592186514704 1075 #edb/ref 17592186514720 13194139535546 17592186045443 true] [17592186514704 1075 #edb/ref 17592186514730 13194139535546 17592186045443 true] [17592186514704 1075 #edb/ref 17592186514731 13194139535546 17592186045443 true] [17592186514704 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139535546 17592186045443 true] [17592186514704 1077 "selection" 13194139535546 17592186045443 true] [17592186514704 1078 #edb/ref 17592186514718 13194139535546 17592186045443 true] [17592186514704 1079 #uuid "11304265-79eb-53d3-b36a-ddf025ee509b" 13194139535546 17592186045443 true] [17592186514705 1080 "y=7" 13194139535546 17592186045443 true] [17592186514705 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535546 17592186045443 true] [17592186514705 1083 #uuid "146c3a47-5c8e-5a5f-b186-cbe3b24f837f" 13194139535546 17592186045443 true] [17592186514706 1080 "y=\\frac{2}{5}x-7" 13194139535546 17592186045443 true] [17592186514706 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535546 17592186045443 true] [17592186514706 1083 #uuid "292bccc8-cc74-5b90-a94d-04dcf6d106bb" 13194139535546 17592186045443 true] [17592186514707 1075 #edb/ref 17592186514701 13194139535546 17592186045443 true] [17592186514707 1075 #edb/ref 17592186514702 13194139535